      <div class="row"><span class="w">1,100</span><span class="c"><b>+</b> sites commissioned across Peninsular Malaysia</span></div>
      <div class="row"><span class="w">60</span><span class="c"><b>+</b> commercial and industrial projects completed</span></div>
      <div class="row"><span class="w">35</span><span class="c"><b>RM million+</b> in customer revenue since 2023</span></div>
      <div class="row"><span class="w">G7</span><span class="c"><b>CIDB grade</b>, the highest, for large multi-discipline projects</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="caps wrap" id="capabilities" aria-labelledby="caps-h">
    <h2 id="caps-h" class="h-head">Capabilities</h2>
    <div class="group">
      <h3>Engineering and construction</h3>
      <ul>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="Design, procurement, construction and commissioning of rooftop PV, by one team with one point of accountability.">Solar EPCC</li>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="String inverters on large uniform roof areas and micro inverters on shaded or complex sections, in one system: higher yield and panel-level data.">Duo Mix systems</li>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="Hybrid and off-grid systems paired with SAJ battery storage, from 48 kWh off-grid sites to training facilities.">Battery storage and off-grid</li>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="Electrical wiring works certified by Suruhanjaya Tenaga, carried out by our in-house electrical team.">Electrical works</li>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="We prepare and submit SEDA and TNB applications. Timelines depend on regulators and utility scheduling.">SEDA and TNB approvals</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="sum">Solar EPCC, Duo Mix systems, battery storage and off-grid, electrical works, and SEDA and TNB approvals.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="group">
      <h3>Financing and schemes</h3>
      <ul>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="As a SEDA Registered PV Investor we finance, build and operate the system; you buy the power at a lower rate. No capital outlay.">Zero-capex solar investment</li>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="Selected as a preferred solar PV partner for all Maybank solar financing products.">Maybank solar financing</li>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="Solar qualifies for a 60% Green Investment Tax Allowance and battery storage for 100%, set off against 70% of statutory income, for capital spent until 31 December 2026.">GITA: 60% solar, 100% storage</li>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="ATAP exports surplus for bill credits; SELCO is full self-consumption. We recommend from your load profile.">ATAP and SELCO</li>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="Corporate green electricity schemes: CRESS for single large buyers, CREAM for aggregated SME demand.">CRESS and CREAM</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="sum">Zero-capex solar investment, Maybank financing, GITA allowances, and advice on ATAP, SELCO, CRESS and CREAM.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="group">
      <h3>Operations</h3>
      <ul>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="Real-time monitoring on SAJ's eSAJ platform, 24 hours a day, with alarms and exportable reports.">eSAJ monitoring</li>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="Connection checks, cleaning inspection and a performance audit every six months.">Six-monthly inspection</li>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="Thermal drone scans find defective cells, connection faults, storm damage and delamination before they cost output.">Thermal drone scanning</li>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="Urgent cases with the system down are attended within 48 hours; standard claims are resolved in 3 to 5 working days.">48-hour fault response</li>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="Scalable charging from a single unit to networked business and fleet sites, with intelligent load management.">EV charging</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="sum">eSAJ monitoring, six-monthly inspection, thermal drone scanning, 48-hour fault response and EV charging.</p>
    </div>
